        "text": "The case is Office of Senator Mark Dayton (appellant) v. Brad Hanson (appellee)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "47f898af6e147194b356ffd95201e8f1c5232cb92f077f4a2de84f26f9d6a900",
            "evidence_ids": [
