                "start": 57
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Ms. Manning, the Senate cannot be directed to pay the judgment; payment comes from the Treasury and the Senate has had no control or involvement in these cases for twelve years."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Appellant Position (Office of Senator Mark Dayton)",
      "status": "complete",
